    "heading": "Level 2: Magical Cunning",
    "lineStart": 4259,
    "lineEnd": 4261
  },
  "section": "3.291",
  "rulesText": "You can perform an esoteric rite for 1 minute. At the end of it, you regain expended Pact Magic spell slots but no more than a number equal to half your maximum (round up). Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest."
}
